    "body_text": "Skip Navigation\n \n\n+ Advanced Search\n\nBurien Municipal Code\nHelp Text Size: -A +A\nTitle 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS\n  Contents\n\nClick the plus (+) or minus (-) symbols to expand or collapse the entries. Click the checkboxes to select sections for saving or printing.\n\nRevised marks sections affected by recently codified ordinances.\n\nClear all\n\n+  Title 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS\n\n+  Title 2 ADMINISTRATION AND PERSONNEL\n\n+  Title 3 REVENUE AND FINANCE Revised 4/26\n\n–  Title 4 (Reserved)\n\n+  Title 5 BUSINESS LICENSES AND REGULATIONS Revised 1/26\n\n+  Title 6 ANIMALS\n\n+  Title 7 CITY PARKS AND RECREATION\n\n+  Title 8 HEALTH AND SAFETY Revised 1/26\n\n+  Title 9 PUBLIC PEACE, MORALS AND WELFARE\n\n+  Title 10 VEHICLES AND TRAFFIC\n\n–  Title 11 (Reserved)\n\n+  Title 12 STREETS AND SIDEWALKS\n\n+  Title 13 WATER AND SEWERS Revised 1/26\n\n+  Title 14 ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION\n\n+  Title 15 BUILDINGS AND CONSTRUCTION Revised 8/26\n\n–  Title 16 (Reserved)\n\n+  Title 17 SUBDIVISIONS\n\n–  Title 18 INTERIM ZONING CODE\n\n+  Title 19 ZONING CODE Revised 8/26\n\n–  Title 19 Archival Version (PDF)\n\n+  Title 20 SHORELINE MASTER PROGRAM\n\n+  STATUTORY REFERENCES FOR WASHINGTON CITIES AND TOWNS\n\n–  RESOLUTION AND ORDINANCE TABLES\n\n  \nTitle 1\nGENERAL PROVISIONS\n\nChapters:\n\n1.01    Code Adoption\n\n1.05    General Provisions\n\n1.10    Initiative and Referendum\n\n1.15    Code Enforcement\n\n  \n\nThe Burien Municipal Code is current through Ordinance 905, and legislation passed through July 27, 2026.\n\nDisclaimer: The City Clerk's Office has the official version of the Burien Municipal Code. Users should contact the City Clerk's Office for ordinances passed subsequent to the ordinance cited above.\n\nCity Website: https://www.burienwa.gov/\nCity Telephone: (206) 241-4647\n\nCodification services provided by General Code\n\nMobile Version",
